{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41494","headline":"和元宗元日大雪登楼 · 李建勳","name":"和元宗元日大雪登楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纷纷忽降当元曾，着物轻明似月华。\n狂洒玉墀初散絮，密黏宫树未妨花。\n迥封双阙千寻峭，冷压南山万仞斜。\n宁意传来中使出，御题先赐老僧家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}